@baseUrl = http://localhost:5257

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Paginated EF Core query
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?q=core&page=1&pageSize=10

### Demonstrate global Problem Details exception handling
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/learning/throw

### Obtain a demo JWT (reader / demo-password)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"reader","password":"demo-password"}

### This POST needs the returned bearer token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"New demo item","price":12.5,"stock":4,"categoryId":1}

### Fire one request through the fixed-window limiter
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/demo/rate-limited
